"""
Seed the North Sea EEZ delimitation lines into map_asset.
Self-contained: 23 offshore boundary lines from the Marine Regions (VLIZ)
`eez_boundaries` dataset, North Sea bbox (-5..10 E, 50..62 N), filtered to
real delimitation types (Treaty, Median line, Unilateral claim (undisputed),
Joint regime and Unsettled variants). Coastal "Straight baseline" /
"Normal baseline", administrative "Connection line" stubs, 12/200 NM outer
limits and stray Russia-Alaska bbox artefacts are excluded on purpose.

Geometry was simplified offline (Douglas-Peucker, ~1 km tolerance):
5,021 -> 160 points, verified max deviation 1.02 km per feature.
Chart-level only; never a navigational reference.

Re-running REPLACES the 'eez_boundaries_ns' source rows only - the Arabian
Gulf seed (source 'eez_boundaries'), manual assets and other sources are
never touched. The EEZ overlay chip stays default OFF (opt-in).

Run in the PORTAL container:
    cd /code && python -m app.tools.seed_eez_north_sea

Source: Flanders Marine Institute (VLIZ), Maritime Boundaries Geodatabase,
marineregions.org.
"""
